{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "kind": "lean-bridge-jvm-sync-resource-acceptance",
  "date": "2026-11-23",
  "planNodes": [
    1221,
    1222
  ],
  "scope": "Local Linux x86-64 Maven JAR/POM installations, JDK 22, Kotlin 2.2.0, Maven 3.9.11 and Lean 4.32.2. glibc 2.36 override on this machine; not a hosted CI run, a registry publication, JPMS module-path evidence, or acceptance of resource-bearing tasks, callbacks or streams.",
  "checks": [
    "Two independently compiled components exchange the same mutable Shared.Ticket in Java and Kotlin on a normal Maven classpath. Both languages accept the compatible nominal type; javac and kotlinc reject both a different kind and Shared.Ticket from a changed source module. The ordinary and reviewed pairs run in both classpath and initialization orders.",
    "Direct parameters borrow; results and EIO error payloads own independent AutoCloseable leases. Public resource classes expose no raw handles, pointers or dispatch. Retain, sameResource, double close, stale use, simultaneous borrow/close, and work on Java virtual threads were exercised. Lean file descriptors and broker identities returned to baseline after normal use and retirement.",
    "Verified original JAR/POM archives, embedded file hashes, class bytes and native dependency order. A raw off-owner release was refused without consuming a live handle; disposal of an abandoned result frame then released it through the owner. A changed ledger from a second JAR was refused even after a compatible peer had loaded.",
    "An explicit async selection, a missing filesystem grant and an altered reviewed resource identity are refused without publishing a partial handoff. A fresh offline-installed CLI reproduces the ordinary JAR, POM, package receipt, binding IR, native-release manifest and elaboration evidence."
  ],
  "reproduce": [
    "Set the tool paths and third-party-only LEAN_BRIDGE_JVM_TASK_M2_SEED as in docs/evidence/jvm-tasks-20261123.json. Use empty EVIDENCE and SECOND destinations, Python 3.11+, readelf, and LEAN_NUM_THREADS=1. Use LEAN_BRIDGE_NATIVE_TEST_GLIBC_FLOOR=2.36 only for the matching local platform.",
    "LEAN_BRIDGE_JVM_RESOURCE_BUILD=$EVIDENCE node --test --test-concurrency=1 tests/helpers/jvm-resource-installed.mjs",
    "LEAN_BRIDGE_JVM_RESOURCE_POLICY=$EVIDENCE node --test --test-concurrency=1 tests/helpers/jvm-resource-installed.mjs",
    "LEAN_BRIDGE_JVM_RESOURCE_CAPTURE=$EVIDENCE node --test --test-concurrency=1 tests/helpers/jvm-resource-acceptance.mjs",
    "LEAN_BRIDGE_JVM_ORIGINAL=$EVIDENCE LEAN_BRIDGE_JVM_REPRO=$SECOND node --test --test-name-pattern='offline-installed CLI in a second producer' tests/helpers/jvm-io-installed.mjs",
    "LEAN_BRIDGE_JVM_RESOURCE_REPLAY=$EVIDENCE LEAN_BRIDGE_JVM_RESOURCE_EXPECTED=docs/evidence/jvm-sync-resources-20261123.json node --test --test-concurrency=1 tests/helpers/jvm-resource-acceptance.mjs"
  ],
